{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110772","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110772/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110772/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110772/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110772","id":3439804490,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7NB0BK","number":110772,"title":"Collider no longer rotates with model in game, works in 4.4.1 and does not work in 4.5","user":{"login":"Polemus","id":112549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus","html_url":"https://github.com/Polemus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Polemus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-09-22T08:44:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T11:18:09Z","closed_at":"2025-11-05T11:18:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducable in 4.5\nNot reproducable in 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 24.04\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a basic scene with a spherical planet, i spawn a prototype cube on the surface ensuring its aligned with the surface. \n\nHere is a screenshot of the cube in the editor:\n\n<img width=\"986\" height=\"306\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f34e064-6551-402e-bb37-05b31d961fca\" />\n\nIn godot 4.4.1 the cube as well as its collision shape is rotated correctly to align with the surface: \n\nHere is a preview of the cube in game using godot 4.4.1:\n\n<img width=\"762\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73a911c6-57f5-4683-8ca4-c9838d205d40\" />\n\nNow, running the game in godot 4.5, and looking at the same spawned prototype cube, you will notice the collider is not alligned properly:\n\nHere is a screenshot running the same project in godot 4.5:\n\n<img width=\"671\" height=\"381\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a49e764-55f1-41b4-8745-efdf3a125cfe\" />\n\nbelow is the code responsible for rotating the cube to the surface:\n\n<img width=\"997\" height=\"522\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/80e8b520-0849-4160-8eb1-cd19744e4612\" />\n\n\nI am not sure if i have missed anything in the release notes that would point me into updating code based on a change, or if it is just a bug.\n\nI have tried making the StaticBody3D a sibling of the mesh, but it produces the same result, i also have to mention i am using Jolt Physics.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCannot reproduce it with a new project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI have created a minimal setup using the exact same logic to align, but in the new sample project it works in both 4.4.1 and 4.5. ","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}